  {
   "text": "For example if the elapsed portion of Revati Nakshatra is 3°-57'-21\". Part 10 ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    363,
    556,
    378
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "ends 3°-42'-13\"-20\". Part 11 ends 4°-4'-26\"-40\". Therefore it falls in 11th part. The ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    387,
    556,
    403
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "effects of this 'taking poison' which means the nature is fed up with life and wants ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    411,
    556,
    427
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "to get rid of it.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    435,
    166,
    451
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "20. The Chandrakriya, Chandra Avastha and Chandravela described above ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    459,
    556,
    475
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "will be found very useful and effective in the case of a birth, muhurta and a quary. ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    484,
    556,
    499
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "One ought therefore to pay particular attention to them before making any ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    508,
    556,
    523
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "prediction.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    532,
    145,
    547
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "21. Paksha Bala (fortnightly strength) is of special importance to the Moon ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    556,
    556,
    572
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "and Sthana Bala is of some importance to the other planets. When this strength ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    580,
    556,
    596
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "added to other kinds of strength of a planet, it will add more strength to that planet. ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    604,
    556,
    620
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "There are many such types of strength.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    629,
    303,
    644
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<b>Number of Bala Pinda</b>",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    653,
    255,
    668
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "22. The Sun is said to be strong where he obtains 6.5 Rupas of strength. The ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    677,
    556,
    692
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Moon is strong with 6 Rupas, Mars with 5 Rupas, Mercury with 7 Rupas, Jupiter ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    701,
    556,
    716
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "with 8.5 Rupas, Venus with 5.5 Rupas.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    725,
    302,
    741
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "23. Saturn is declared strong with 5 Rupas of strength. If Shadbala Pinda of ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    749,
    556,
    765
   ]
  },
